<title>CANADA: Renaissance sets C$316 mln share issue.</title>
<headline>Renaissance sets C$316 mln share issue.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Renaissance Energy Ltd said on Tuesday it agreed to issue eight million common shares to a group of underwriters for C$39.50 each.</p>
<p>The purchase was scheduled to close on October 1, Renaissance said.  </p>
<p>Renaissance said earlier this month it would use the proceeds to expand its capital spending in the fourth quarter of this year and in 1997.</p>
<p>It said it planned to spend C$800 million and drill 1,850 wells in 1997.</p>
<p>The offering will be made in the United States only through a prospectus, Renaissance said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
